<img
  src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0625/2140/9636/files/FEED_NEW_YEAR.png?v=1734785689"
  width="100%"
  height="100%"
  alt="new year banner"
>
<section class="edmonton-section">
  <h1 class="new-year-main-heading">Feed Vapes New Year Sale – New Year Vape Sales in Canada!</h1>
  <!-- <a href="https://feedvapor.com/"><p>Visit our home page</p></a> -->
  <p>
    Celebrate the New Year 2025 with amazing savings at Feed Vapes! Enjoy exclusive New Year Vape Sales on Feed Sync,
    Feed Freezie, and Feed Pods. Plus, <b>get Buy 3, Get 1 Free</b>, and stock up for the year ahead. Don't miss out on
    New Year Disposable vape sales in Canada!
  </p>

  <h2 class="coll-heading">Feed Sync</h2>
  <p>
    Experience the ultimate in convenience and flavor with Feed Sync (Smart Vape). Take advantage of our New Year offer
    and <b>get Buy 3, Get 1 Free</b> — the best price to enjoy this high-quality device at a fraction of the cost.
  </p>
  <!-- Start Feed Sync Product Slider -->
  <div class="slider">
    <div class="swiper mySwiper">
      <div class="swiper-wrapper">
        {% for product in collections['feed-sync-25k-disposable-vape'].products %}
          <div class="swiper-slide">
            <div>
              {% render 'custom-card',
                card_product: product,
                is_out_of_stock: false,
                media_aspect_ratio: section.settings.image_ratio,
                image_shape: section.settings.image_shape,
                show_shop_now: true,
                section_id: section.id
              %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <!-- <div class="swiper-pagination"></div> -->
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- End Feed Sync Product Slider -->

  <h2 class="coll-heading">FEED FREEZIE</h2>
  <p>
    Cool off with Feed Freezie and enjoy a refreshing vape experience! Get in on our exclusive New Year sale,
    <b>get Buy 3, Get 1 Free</b>, and save on your next favorite flavor.
  </p>
  <!-- Start Feed Freezie Product Slider -->
  <div class="slider">
    <div class="swiper mySwiper">
      <div class="swiper-wrapper">
        {% for product in collections['feed-freezie-disposable-pods'].products %}
          <div class="swiper-slide">
            <div>
              {% render 'custom-card',
                card_product: product,
                is_out_of_stock: false,
                media_aspect_ratio: section.settings.image_ratio,
                image_shape: section.settings.image_shape,
                show_shop_now: true,
                section_id: section.id
              %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <!-- <div class="swiper-pagination"></div> -->
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- End Feed Freezie Product Slider -->

  <h2 class="coll-heading">Feed Pods</h2>
  <p>
    Ready to elevate your vaping experience? Feed Pods deliver a smooth, satisfying hit every time. Don’t miss our New
    Year sale — <b>Buy 3, Get 1 Free</b>, and save on the best vaping tech in Canada!
  </p>
  <!-- Start Feed Freezie Product Slider -->
  <div class="slider">
    <div class="swiper mySwiper">
      <div class="swiper-wrapper">
        {% for product in collections['vape-pods-in-canada'].products %}
          <div class="swiper-slide">
            <div>
              {% render 'custom-card',
                card_product: product,
                is_out_of_stock: false,
                media_aspect_ratio: section.settings.image_ratio,
                image_shape: section.settings.image_shape,
                show_shop_now: true,
                section_id: section.id
              %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <!-- <div class="swiper-pagination"></div> -->
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- End Feed Freezie Product Slider -->
</section>

<style>
  .new-year-main-heading{
    margin-bottom: 40px !important;
  }
  .slider {
    position: relative;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .swiper {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .coll-heading{
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
</style>

<!-- Swiper JS -->
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.js"></script>

<!-- Initialize Swiper -->
<script>
  var swiper = new Swiper(".mySwiper", {
    slidesPerView: 1,
    spaceBetween: 0,
    pagination: {
      el: ".swiper-pagination",
      clickable: true,
    },
    breakpoints: {
      "@0.00": {
        slidesPerView: 1.5,
        spaceBetween: 10,
      },
      "@0.75": {
        slidesPerView: 2.5,
        spaceBetween: 10,
      },
      "@1.00": {
        slidesPerView: 3.5,
        spaceBetween: 10,
      },
      "@1.50": {
        slidesPerView: 4.5,
        spaceBetween: 10,
      },
    },
  });
</script>

